			"notes": "### Patches\n- Completely remade how pressing messages works, making it possible to copy messages from any area in the line (even where there's no text) and allowing the user to now be forced to hold a key before copying messages (configurable and optional);\n- Remade how tooltips work under a similar approach as above;\n- Made alerts less intrusive and now configurable (you may disable them if you want, but they are way less intrusive now and use tooltips for them, no sound).\n### Minor Changes\n- Copying to clipboard now uses Minecraft's clipboard methods;\n- Minor bug fixes."
